{"server":"cn","storyId":"act33side_level_act33side_03_end","groupId":"act33side","stageId":"act33side_03","title":"无声破裂","storyCode":"BB-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"f319c9fa055c1e7d87eea173911e155152e9230c4694ba62af1ebcd33a61b37e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"卡兹戴尔城内，不同理念的萨卡兹之间的冲突终于到了不可收拾的地步，特蕾西娅最终决定带着支持自己的人民离开自己的家园。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡兹戴尔地区，卡兹戴尔移动城市"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我过去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹王庭军","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面已经封锁了，不能通行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边发生什么事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹王庭军","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是巴别塔的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我，我不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹王庭军","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就与你无关。"},{"type":"narration","text":"奥达被挡在王庭军的人墙之外。\n但在慌乱散开的人群中，他看到了几张熟悉的，正在哭泣的面孔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那些学生......？这些房子......从小巷里绕一下，我应该能过去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以告诉我那边到底发生什么事了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人当街弄死了人，动手的人也死了。你要去凑热闹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激愤的平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是巴别塔，也不知道殿下到底打算做什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......住嘴，尊重殿下！你吃的穿的住的不都是殿下为你带来的？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激愤的平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情很简单——一个老师动手把自己学生的父亲给打死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师？怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激愤的平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那孩子的父亲不过骂了他两句！是那个老师自己说了些教坏小孩的话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是这样的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讥讽的平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也帮巴别塔说话？这样的年轻人他们都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讥讽的平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你过去干什么？"},{"type":"narration","text":"奥达挤过了街道上的人群，他看到一些熟悉的面孔已经倒在地上。\n当他好不容易来到混乱的源头时，他终于在扬起的尘埃中找到了那位“老师”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师！到底是怎么回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......真的没想......伤害......他爸爸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我带你去找医生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......那边......救他......"},{"type":"narration","text":"垂死的人指向了他一直望着的方向，奥达看到了一位受伤的孩子，守候在毫无动静的父亲身旁哭泣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"奥达抱着受伤的孩子，穿越火光四起的街道时，终于从人群中拼凑出了一个真相。\n一位激动的老师误杀了一位激动的父亲，随后被愤怒的人群包围，倒在了街道的尘埃里。\n平民，巴别塔，佣兵，或许还有军事委员会，越来越多的人被卷入其中。\n那里扬起的尘埃，从城市的一角，扩散到了城市的另一角......\n直到巴别塔办事处的外墙被来源未知的炮火轰碎，王庭军才终于镇压下了这场引起轩然大波的混乱。\n从一场意外开始，到一枚炮弹结束。巴别塔遭遇了自十八年前那场战争后，最大的损失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要逼我动手，这个孩子已经受伤了，需要医生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你是哪边的？巴别塔？军事委员会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都不是，我只是想带他去找医生，请让开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虚弱的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我爸爸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来不及了......对不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。但不要轻信外人......萨卡兹，现在局势很混乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......"},{"type":"narration","text":"奥达沉默地抱着孩子向前走去，孩子的呼吸逐渐衰微。\n穿过街道时，奥达好像感觉到有人与他擦肩而过，但他却什么也没看到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......错觉吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住！不要往前走了，里面还有病人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个孩子需要救治，现在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......现在这时候，你们还愿意把病人送来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，交给我。离开前，我会尽可能再给你们多留点药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是殿下的决定。不过我们都清楚，其实是卡兹戴尔不再欢迎我们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们要到哪里去呢？城外？荒野上那么危险，你不害怕吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果这座城市不再接受我们，我们也尊重这座城市的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想留在巴别塔帮些忙。照顾病人也好，帮你们维护安全也行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷淡的王庭军","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他就是引起骚乱的源头吗？他还能活吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的王庭军","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失血过多，看上去救不回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷淡的王庭军","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们为什么还要守在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的王庭军","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按将军说的做，少问问题。谁能想到，一件小事最后闹到两位殿下不得不表态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的王庭军","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不会想和我们说话吧？这也没其他人啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷淡的王庭军","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"临死前的幻觉吧。像他这样的罪人，总不会有女妖来为他唱挽歌吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里......危险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......快走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，他们看不透我的咒术，也抓不住我的身形。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个学生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沿着母亲的足迹自远方而来，我想在这座游荡的城市中寻求一些问题的答案，期待着两位殿下能够给我些许启迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......找到......答案了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能来得并不是时候，这座城市现在还无法给我答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我发现了你。你宣扬的理想与主张，让我很感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当你躲在地下室里为那些孩子们授课的时候，我一直留在你们身边了解这座城市，了解巴别塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，没人发现我......除了阿斯卡纶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个......孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他被人保护着，送到巴别塔接受治疗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于你自己的结局，你后悔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......有孩子为我......辩护......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有孩子......理解......我想改变的......东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但......我对不起......我伤害了他的父亲——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我为你感到惋惜，这样的悲剧并非你本意，命运的愚弄偏偏降临在你身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我听到......哭声......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是挽歌，它在彼岸呼唤你的逐渐黯淡的灵光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必害怕，亦不必犹豫，众魂会接纳你，我的歌声会陪伴你前往彼岸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老师”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年轻女妖的歌喉抚平了即将死去之人的激荡思绪。\n轻柔的吟唱萦绕在人潮汹涌的街道，引动着散落于城市各处的共鸣。女妖们回应着年轻女妖的哀曲，为其和音。\n挽歌轻唱，纪念着一位平凡萨卡兹的离去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“在课堂上，你对巴别塔的未来没有讲完，后面是什么？”\n“我认为......巴别塔注定会死去，但希望不会。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g5_furnaceplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌声，又一位萨卡兹在这场混乱中逝去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座城市不再有巴别塔的容身之处。我会带领他们离开这座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，特蕾西娅，我们都是爱戴您的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。但是巴别塔别无选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您的离开......将会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的人民已经做出了选择，我与特雷西斯都无法扭转他们的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还不能放弃希望。但现在，避免冲突是最好的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......仇恨会如洪流般吞噬我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您早就知道......特蕾西娅，我们的英雄，我们的王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温柔的祈求和温吞的变革，是说服不了因卡兹戴尔的崛起而被吸引至此的萨卡兹们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......菈玛莲，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我会伤了您的心，特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷姆必拓，萨尔贡，甚至是哥伦比亚......您已经敲开了他们的门，让萨卡兹平等地和一些人......对视。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而又过了五十多年，泰拉大陆发生了过去几千年都未曾有过的技术变革，日新月异。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我们的步伐还是太慢了。您给卡兹戴尔带来的这些匪夷所思的变化，仍只是变化，还没有开花结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕，我也相信结果的春天已近在眼前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这代表了女妖王庭现在的态度吗，菈玛莲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次我只是一个来送孩子远行的母亲，特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尊重他的想法，他也将代表王庭的态度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......不是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很爱他，我能看出来......你将自己的时间凝固了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哀珐尼尔是我的奇迹，也注定成为女妖们的奇迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自他出生的那一刻起，我就不愿随着岁月变迁而衰老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我最为美丽的瞬间，我希望在他的记忆中......我亦是永恒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，不变的只有外表，我的寿命终有一天会抵尽头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的殿下。我知道您在想什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您本就觉得，这一代人无法完成您的宏愿，您本就觉得，您是土壤，不必见繁花盛开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕用您二位的一切来滋润这片土壤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"满足我的小小私心吧，殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此后的几年中，在他寻找到自己想要的答案前，他会来往于你们之间学习，接受你们的启迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他会成为钻出土壤的第一株顽强的幼苗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请带上哀珐尼尔。请照顾好他。请替我保护他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会的，菈玛莲。我的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论将来的你们身处何处，无论你们之中谁将走向消亡，我与女妖的王庭都会共同为你们唱响挽歌，告知所有人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的许诺，是最古老强大的巫术，是我能为你们送出的最后离别之礼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菈玛莲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这会是我们最后一次见面吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，再见吧，我还想在河谷的氤氲间听见你的轻唱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见，殿下。但是很抱歉，我只会留在这里，目送您远行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，哀珐尼尔将会加入你们的队伍，我......还不忍与他告别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g6_babeloffice"},{"type":"narration","text":"两天后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还准备待多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想等特蕾西娅，那你来得稍早了一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你不敢来见我，阿斯卡纶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是为什么你不敢来见我，还是为什么我要驱逐巴别塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经见过曼弗雷德了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动手了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没动杀心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你开口说些幼稚的话前，离开吧。就算是特蕾西娅也不会同意你的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，你也可以不解释任何事。留下。你从来没有正式加入过巴别塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可殿下需要人保护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她比你想的还要强大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而且我更加不认同你，老师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会把这句话当做你的拒绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和曼弗雷德都是我最得意的学生，你们都有自己致命的缺点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在战斗上的天赋出众，无人能及，但......你究竟有没有自己的信念？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太急躁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说的是，“你自己的信念”。不是我的。不是特蕾西娅的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你至今还不明白自己在追求什么，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保护？笼统而虚无的自我欺骗。你在迷茫之时只能将自己的动机投射到感性的情感之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......想得很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就跟着特蕾西娅，保护好她。但也不要盲从于她，自己去想。曼弗雷德比你早很多得出答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一次再见我的时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。阿斯卡纶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在无话可说。"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡纶单膝向特雷西斯跪下，随后化作了雾气缭绕在特雷西斯的身边。\n雾气颤动，继而消散，无影无踪，留下的，唯有特雷西斯手上的一柄石刃。\n他想起了自己在天灾中抓住这个孩子的那一天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对她太冷酷了，特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离别之时，你可以给她说说心里话，她不是一个擅长表达情感的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你比我更擅长教育她作为青年的那一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对她真的没有信心吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我随时欢迎她回来。曼弗雷德在武艺上还是太懈怠，她会是个好师姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会转告她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更希望你也能回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这短暂的分裂都无法弥合，下次，我们面对的会是真正的内战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你我百余年的畅想，就皆是空谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到那时，如果不得不做，我会杀你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴别塔也都准备好了，愿意跟随我们的人会一起出城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你总是带着他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，他们需要我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我也需要你，卡兹戴尔同样需要魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的子民已经做出了选择，至少现在，巴别塔的退让，是最好的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会继续为卡兹戴尔唤来甘露，切实地改变这座城市的现状，等待恨意的平息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果在这个或许确实漫长的过程中，你成了那些尚且懵懂的理想者们最大的威胁，我也会毁灭你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"成排的雇佣兵与王庭军伫立在街道的两侧维持着秩序，他们挡住了躁动不安的人们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"魔王带来足以果腹的食物与可以避寒的楼宇。\n魔王无视人民遭受的压迫与积累的仇恨。\n一支望不到尾的巴别塔队伍背负着行囊默默前行，走过王庭军队列的人墙，走过了唾弃他们的人群身边。\n特雷西斯走向人群，站在他们的身边。\n近两百年来，他第一次离开了特蕾西娅的身侧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都清楚自己将要面对什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望这不会是你我最后一次并肩而立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那一天还远吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会太远。"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西娅走进了沉默的队列之中。与城市的告别是无声的，他们走在希望的道路上。\n此刻，喧闹的声音黯淡下去，缓缓流动的队伍却有了片刻的停滞。\n不再有谩骂，不再有哭泣，所有人都看到了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i05"},{"type":"narration","text":"维持秩序的佣兵跨出了队列，紧紧拥抱住人流中的挚友。\n在巴别塔的废墟旁，他们在各自的耳畔说着什么，没人能听清，但所有人都愿意为他们的告别而驻足。\n人民与人民的诀别，人民与城市的诀别。\n那位已孤身一人的萨卡兹也行走在人流之中，没有遗憾。\n他想起了那年自己跟着那位大哥哥出城寻找父母，他们也走在脚下这同一条道路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我相信，战争之外，一定还有一条路，爸爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，妈妈如此相信巴别塔，也是因为她渴望有不一样的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再见了，爸爸，妈妈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再见了，家乡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西娅亲启，\n我听闻了那座城市正在发生的事情，我对你的失落感同身受，卡兹戴尔于我们都有着特殊的意义。\n但是巴别塔无需如无根之萍一般在荒野上流浪，我已经在雷姆必拓找到了我向你提起过的那艘舰船。\n挖掘工作很顺利，两年的修复工作让这艘船已经恢复了基本的功能。\n今后，它将载着巴别塔的希望继续航行。请等我回来，特蕾西娅。\n另：我确实在这艘船内找到了它。\n这是足以颠覆这个世界的遗产，而这是你们所生活的世界。\n我想我有义务与你共同讨论。\n——凯尔希"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
